</style></head><body><main class="shell"><header class="brand">✦ Northstar Bank</header><section class="progress"><div><span id="pt">Getting started</span><span id="pc">Step 1 of 6</span></div><p class="bar"><span id="pb" class="initial-progress"></span></p></section><section id="app" aria-live="polite">Loading secure setup…</section><footer class="hint">Take your time. There is no reading timer.</footer></main>
